----------------------------------------------------

Modifiers may hold strings and escaped brackets. Every key the engine accepts is
highlighted (lite/ielt.cpp). The abbreviations s, look, da, dcc, deacc, dj and xs
must be lowercase, so S and LOOK stay plain. Words in a match list are literals,
not keys.
